{"id":"28295021724","kind":"article","title":"关于谎言和黑天鹅事件","author":"Eliezer Yudkowsky","original_authors":["Eliezer Yudkowsky"],"original_source_urls":["https://www.readthesequences.com/Of-Lies-And-Black-Swan-Blowups"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"理性 & 克服偏见","date":"2025-03-08","updated":"2026-07-22","votes":22,"comment_count":1,"minutes":1,"chars":524,"keywords":["谎言","黑天鹅事件","合理化","证据选择"],"summary":"译文以澳大利亚法官 Marcus Einfeld 的案例为例：一张超速罚单引出伪证，最终使其入狱。作者借此引出一种关于谎言会因细节留下痕迹、最终戏剧性崩塌的理论，同时提醒现实中支持该理论的故事也经过选择性报道。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/28295021724","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"xvbOQlHF\">Marcus Einfeld 法官，70 岁，自 1977 年以来担任御用大律师，1997 年被评为澳大利亚的国宝级人物，2002 年获得联合国和平奖，曾是澳大利亚人权和平等机会委员会的创始主席。几年前退休，但仍常被召回审理重要案件……</p><p data-pid=\"CFol4MOY\">……却因一系列伪证和谎言<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marcus Einfeld#Criminal_conviction\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">入狱</a>两年，而这一切<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://news.bbc.co.uk/2/hi/uk_news/magazine/7967982.stm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">始于一张超速 6 英里每小时的 36 英镑罚单</a>。</p><p data-pid=\"RTKHFOxf\">有一种<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.readthesequences.com/Entangled-Truths-Contagious-Lies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">理论</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>听起来<b>似乎格外崇高</b>，它声称诚实的人不擅长说谎，谎言总会在某处留下千丝万缕的痕迹，最终整个骗局会像黑天鹅事件一样戏剧性地崩塌。事实上，现实生活中<b>确实</b>存在一些印证这一理论的例子，尽管我们听到这样的事情时，显然是经过选择性报道的。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"IEqTgv0u\">总目录：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"《理性：从人工智能到僵尸》导读与目录\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2056344770390373406\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《理性：从人工智能到僵尸》导读与目录</a><p data-pid=\"S4oUANLL\">卷：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"第二卷：如何真正改变你的想法\" data-tm-id=\"2015489803068651120\" href=\"#/post/2015489803068651120\">第二卷：如何真正改变你的想法</a><p data-pid=\"rmheunbV\">章节：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"反对合理化\" data-tm-id=\"30664297001\" href=\"#/post/30664297001\">反对合理化</a><p data-pid=\"BDfE24E2\">上一篇：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-142522f206107aa2c729a1fd9a49b761_qhd.jpg\" data-image-height=\"5304\" data-image-width=\"7952\" data-tm-id=\"28043168145\" href=\"#/post/28043168145\">Thoughts Memo：关联的真理，传染的谎言</a><p data-pid=\"oCqsCHXT\">下一篇：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-f16645451567ca6b53714a55dc45d83c_qhd.jpg\" data-image-height=\"3000\" data-image-width=\"4000\" data-tm-id=\"30421407549\" href=\"#/post/30421407549\">Thoughts Memo：黑暗面的认识论</a><hr/><blockquote data-pid=\"JQ0ewiTF\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 <span class=\"nolink\">c</span>laude-3.5-sonnet，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.readthesequences.com/Of-Lies-And-Black-Swan-Blowups\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Of Lies and Black Swan Blowups (readthesequences.com)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 关联的真理，传染的谎言 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"28043168145\" href=\"#/post/28043168145\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"28043168145","title":"关联的真理，传染的谎言","author":"Eliezer Yudkowsky","votes":26,"minutes":5,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 理性 & 克服偏见"},{"id":"30421407549","title":"黑暗面的认识论","author":"Eliezer Yudkowsky","votes":62,"minutes":7,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 理性 & 克服偏见"},{"id":"30664297001","title":"反对合理化","author":"Rob Bensinger","votes":19,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"2015489803068651120","title":"第二卷：如何真正改变你的想法","author":"Rob Bensinger","votes":58,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[{"id":"120290074045","title":"成年人的世界到处是谎言，为什么还要教育小孩不能说谎，是不是教育错了？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":71,"minutes":5,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 71 赞同","evidence":"回答正文含明确指向该译文的知乎内链/链接卡，按直接提及记为1级。"}]}